[MissionBerezov]
MissionName = Operation Citadel: Berezov
BriefingText = Your Tiger is deployed here as the spearhead of our attack, with the Panzer IVs of your own Zug Falke alongside you. KG Kaiser will advance behind. Smash the AT-gun positions and armor defending Berezov, then push through Gremuchi - expect heavy concentrations of Soviet armor there and to the north. Reach Gonki as the day's final objective. Move quickly; the fate of the assault rests on breaking through before the Russian can reinforce.
ObjectivesText = Clear Berezov and Gremuchi, destroy the Soviet HQ, and reach Gonki.
Objective01 = Clear the AT-gun and armor positions around Berezov
Objective02 = Push through Gremuchi and destroy the Soviet armor there
Objective03 = Reach Gonki - the day's final objective
Objective04 = Bonus: destroy the Soviet HQ

